      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. I want to dig a bit deeper into the 'validity' part of my question. Looking at the opposition's points—like the stuff about energy shortages and economic instability—do you think those are legitimate, evidence-based risks that the bill needs to address, or are they mostly just rhetoric used to protect legacy energy interests?",
